# Files Semgrep does not scan.
#
# The doctype definitions give the "All" role rights on purpose: everyone who
# signs in to Cafe is a plain website user, and posting, liking, commenting and
# following are what they do. Writes are limited to the owner ("if_owner") and
# read access is narrowed in code (see cafe/cafe/doctype/post/post.py). The
# rule "avoid the All role" is written for apps with internal staff roles.
cafe/cafe/doctype/**/*.json

# Built browser bundles (minified third-party code, made from vendor_src).
cafe/public/builder_assets/
